OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Lights dance across UK
OL,4,Asky on Halloween night
OL,5,
OL,6,FStargazers around the UK were treated
OL,7,Fto the vivid colours of the aurora
OL,8,Fborealis on Saturday night.
OL,10,FAs cloud and rain on the weather front
OL,11,Fcleared southwards, parts of Scotland
OL,12,Fand Northern Ireland were perfectly
OL,13,Fplaced to catch the display.
OL,15,FThe eerie glow provided a fitting
OL,16,Ffinale to spookiest night of the year,
OL,17,Fdelighting skywatchers and
OL,18,Fphotographers alike.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
