OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Lights dance across UK
OL,4,Asky on Halloween night
OL,5,
OL,6,FAurora activity continued into Sunday
OL,7,Fnight, especially across northern
OL,8,Fskies, but resulted in less intense
OL,9,Fdisplays.
